OL,3,GNEWSAHow rapist priest exploited
OL,4,Acharisma to abuse his 'cult-like'
OL,5,Acongregation
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the detailed written instructions
OL,8,Fgiven to the young women who worked
OL,9,Fwithout pay in the then-Reverend Chris
OL,10,FBrain's house, there was a revealing
OL,11,Fdemand.
OL,13,FThe homebase team, as they were known,
OL,14,Fwere to "do anything" the Church of
OL,15,FEngland priest asked of them.
OL,17,FRoutine tasks - assigned on a rota 24
OL,18,Fhours a day, seven days a week -
OL,19,Fincluded cooking, cleaning, ironing,
OL,20,Fshopping, looking after Brain's young
OL,21,Fdaughter, and walking his dog.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
