OL,3,GNEWSAHow rapist priest exploited
OL,4,Acharisma to abuse his 'cult-like'
OL,5,Acongregation
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis housework was intended to free
OL,8,FBrain for his mission of leading the
OL,9,FNine O'Clock Service (NOS), a radical
OL,10,Fcongregation of hundreds of young
OL,11,Fpeople drawn weekly to a Sheffield
OL,12,Fchurch in the 1980s and 1990s by a
OL,13,Ffusion of rave culture, live music,
OL,14,Fenvironmental activism and liturgy.
